= Teaching

== New Mexico State University
=== Graduate Assistant, Department of ET and SE (January – May 2023)
Instructed *Communication Systems I (ET 314)* through theory and lab sessions. Mentored students on weekly assignments and projects and facilitated interactive discussions.

=== Graduate Research and Teaching Assistant, Department of ECE (August 2021 – May 2022)
Taught more than 50 students concepts in *electronics, digital circuit design, and VHDL*. Supported weekly assignments and projects through discussion and mentoring.

== BRAC University
=== Adjunct Faculty, Department of CSE (February – September 2021)
Conducted theory and lab classes for *VLSI Design (CSE 460)* and *Digital Electronics and Pulse Techniques (CSE 350)*. Labs used Proteus, Quartus II, Microwind, and ModelSim.

